  "notes": [
    "Calendar regressions preceded the settings presentation and shared search correction. Their ordinary Month/inspector/Day/Week paths remain unchanged. The two final timezone and two shared Item/Itinerary planning-zone functions qualify the affected controls on both devices.",
    "Tablet medium-sheet Toggle interaction failed. Whole-row activation, frame removal and view-identity changes did not fix it. Default native Form presentation allowed the Toggle; active search then hid Done after popping. The final searched child invokes dismissSearch before dismissal.",
